#. L_LIP_037
msgid "Who are you?\n"
msgstr "Qui êtes-vous?\n"

#. L_LIP_038
msgid "Hey - you've got my clothes.\n"
msgstr "Hé! Mais c'est mes fringues!\n"

#. L_LIP_039
msgid "Help - help!\n"
msgstr "Au...au secours!\n"

#. L_LIP_040
msgid "Don't shoot me!\n"
msgstr "Ne me tuez pas!\n"

#. L_LIP_041
msgid "Oh, my God - a gun!\n"
msgstr "Oh, mon Dieu! Une arme!\n"

#. L_LIP_042
msgid "There's an intruder in the complex.\n"
msgstr "Il y a un intrus dans le complexe.\n"

#. L_LIP_043
msgid "Give me back my clothes - or else!\n"
msgstr "Donnez-moi mes vêtements, sinon...!\n"

#. L_LIP_044
msgid "Right - you've asked for it!\n"
msgstr "OK. Tu l'auras voulu, poulette!\n"

#. L_LIP_045
msgid "Give me my clothes.\n"
msgstr "Donnez-moi mes fringues.\n"

#. L_LIP_046
msgid "I don't have much time!!!\n"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas beaucoup de temps!!!\n"

#. L_LIP_047
msgid "The enemy has discovered the disguise.\n"
msgstr "L'ennemi a détecté le costume.\n"

#. L_LIP_048
msgid "Virus has already been downloaded.\n"
msgstr "Virus déjà téléchargé.\n"

#. L_LIP_049
msgid "Initiating virus download.\n"
msgstr "Lancement téléchargement virus.\n"

#. L_LIP_050
msgid "So, you got here at last.\n"
msgstr "Enfin vous voilà.\n"

#. L_LIP_051
msgid "Hey, you're not... SECURITY ALERT!\n"
msgstr "Mais, vous n'êtes pas... ALEEEERTE!\n"

#. L_LIP_052
msgid "No guns allowed in here - put your weapon away.\n"
msgstr "Armes interdites! Rangez votre arme.\n"

#. L_LIP_053
msgid "I won't tell you again - lose the weapon.\n"
msgstr "Je ne le répèterai pas: lâchez votre arme!\n"

#. L_LIP_054
msgid "Right - I'm calling security.\n"
msgstr "Bon. J'appelle la sécurité.\n"

#. L_LIP_055
msgid "Everyone's been waiting for you...\n"
msgstr "Tout le monde vous attendait...\n"

#. L_LIP_056
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "Personnel crucial abattu.\n"

#. L_LIP_057
msgid "Cannot gain access to autopsy lab.\n"
msgstr "Accès au labo d'autopsie impossible.\n"

#. L_LIP_058
msgid "Hey, that's not Harry. It's an intruder.\n"
msgstr "Hé! Ce n'est pas Harry. C'est un intrus!\n"

#. L_LIP_059
msgid "Obtain op room key card.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir carte salle d'opération.\n"

#. L_LIP_060
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Garde: \n"

#. L_LIP_061
msgid "Op room key card\n"
msgstr "Carte salle d'opération\n"

#. L_LIP_062
msgid "Op room key card\n"
msgstr "Carte salle d'opération\n"

#. L_LIP_063
msgid "Picked up operation room key card.\n"
msgstr "Carte salle d'opération obtenue.\n"

#. L_LIP_064
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis a été abattu.\n"

#. L_LIP_065
msgid "Get the hell out of here!\n"
msgstr "Sortez de là, bon Dieu!!\n"

#. L_LIP_066
msgid "Containment unit raised up.\n"
msgstr "Caisson élevé.\n"

#. L_LIP_067
msgid "Containment unit lowered down.\n"
msgstr "Caisson abaissé.\n"

#. L_LIP_068
msgid "Mission critical equipment destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Equipement crucial détruit.\n"

#. L_LIP_069
msgid "Obtain X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Obtenir scanner rayons X.\n"

#. L_LIP_070
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_LIP_071
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Scanner rayons X\n"

#. L_LIP_072
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Scanner rayons X\n"

#. L_LIP_073
msgid "Picked up X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Scanner rayons X obtenu.\n"

#. L_LIP_074
msgid "Scanner target acquired.\n"
msgstr "Cible scanner accrochée.\n"

#. L_LIP_075
msgid "Target ID confirmed - XT origin.\n"
msgstr "ID cible confirmée - origine extraterr.\n"

#. L_LIP_076
msgid "Scanner lock lost.\n"
msgstr "Cible scanner perdue.\n"

#. L_LIP_077
msgid "Disguise has been worn.\n"
msgstr "Costume porté.\n"

#. L_LIP_078
msgid ""
"The showers... Now, if I can convince someone \n"
"to part with their uniform...\n"
msgstr ""
"Les douches... Il faut convaincre quelqu'un \n"
"de se séparer de son uniforme...\n"

#. L_LIP_079
msgid ""
"The temperature's dropping... You must be \n"
"close to the cryo room.\n"
msgstr ""
"La température tombe... La salle de \n"
"cryogénisation est proche.\n"

#. L_LIP_080
msgid ""
"The air's heavily recycled around here - must\n"
" be near the autopsy lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'air est recyclé par ici... Le labo\n"
" d'autopsie est par là.\n"

#. L_LIP_081
msgid "There he is, Jo! Hurry or you'll be too late!\n"
msgstr "Le voilà, Joanna! Faites vite!\n"

#. L_LIP_082
msgid "Leave this area now.\n"
msgstr "Quitter cette zone maintenant.\n"

#. L_LIP_083
msgid "Should you be in here?\n"
msgstr "Vous avez le droit d'être ici, vous?\n"

#. L_LIP_084
msgid "Holy...\n"
msgstr "Nom de D...\n"

#. L_LIP_085
msgid "It's a spy!\n"
msgstr "C'est une espionne!\n"

#. L_LIP_086
msgid "Warn the others...\n"
msgstr "Prévenez les autres...\n"

#. L_LIP_087
msgid "Imposter!\n"
msgstr "Imposteur!\n"

#. L_LIP_088
msgid "Lighting systems overloaded.\n"
msgstr "Surcharge systèmes d'éclairage.\n"

#. L_LIP_089
msgid "Alternative entrance to medlabs created.\n"
msgstr "Entrée supplémentaire aux labos créée.\n"

#. L_LIP_090
msgid ""
"The problem you have is that there is no \n"
"way to sneak into the research section. \n"
"The only way in available to you is a \n"
"weak section of wall I've marked in the \n"
"room beyond the stores. It can be destroyed \n"
"with explosives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pourrez trouver un moyen d'investir \n"
"la zone de recherche, croyez-moi. \n"
"La seule possibilité reste une cloison \n"
"que j'ai repérée dans une salle après \n"
"l'entrepôt. Essayez de la faire sauter.\n"

#. L_LIP_091
msgid ""
"Doesn't sound like a problem to me. Where \n"
"are these explosives?\n"
msgstr ""
"Pas de problème. Et où sont \n"
"les explosifs?\n"

#. L_LIP_092
msgid "In that crate.\n"
msgstr "Dans cette caisse.\n"

#. L_LIP_093
msgid "Cute. Very cute.\n"
msgstr "Hé hé. Terrible.\n"

#. L_LIP_094
msgid ""
"By the way, the stores are crawling with \n"
"guards. It may go against your nature, but \n"
"try sneaking through rather than blasting \n"
"everything.\n"
msgstr ""
"Au fait, l'entrepôt est bourré de vigiles. \n"
"Bien que ce ne soit pas votre genre, essayez \n"
"de vous faire discrète plutôt que de buter \n"
"tout le monde.\n"

#. L_LIP_095
msgid "Certainly. Any other pearls of wisdom?\n"
msgstr "Entendu. Autre chose, maestro?\n"

#. L_LIP_096
msgid "That crate...\n"
msgstr "Cette caisse...\n"

#. L_LIP_097
msgid "Yes?\n"
msgstr "Oui?\n"

#. L_LIP_098
msgid "It really doesn't like being shot.\n"
msgstr "Elle n'aime pas qu'on lui tire dessus.\n"

#. L_LIP_099
msgid ""
"Great. Now, if I can just fight the urge \n"
"to report him to Base Security...\n"
msgstr ""
"Parfait. Bon... On va dire que \n"
"lui il m'énerve...\n"

#. L_LIP_100
msgid ""
"Put your hands up and step away from the \n"
"alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"Levez les mains et écartez-vous de \n"
"l'extraterrestre.\n"

#. L_LIP_101
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \n"
"This is supposed to be a sealed room! \n"
"Don't you know anything about autopsy \n"
"procedures?\n"
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce que vous foutez ici? \n"
"Cette salle doit être scellée! \n"
"Ne connaissez-vous pas les consignes \n"
"d'une autopsie?\n"

#. L_LIP_102
msgid ""
"Don't make me tell you again, Doctor. And \n"
"turn that laser off.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ne me faites pas répéter, Docteur. Et \n"
"éteignez-moi ce laser tout de suite.\n"

#. L_LIP_103
msgid ""
"Director Easton will hear about this, \n"
"young lady.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le Directeur Easton en sera informé, \n"
"mademoiselle.\n"

#. L_LIP_104
msgid ""
"Of course he's going to hear of it, you \n"
"moron. I've just got into his top secret \n"
"base, and now I'm stealing his alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mais j'y compte bien, mon cher! \n"
"Je me suis amusée dans sa jolie base et \n"
"maintenant je vole son joujou.\n"

